   "text": "University of Brighton International College - Foundation - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of Brighton International College - Foundation\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nThe University of Brighton is a progressive, modern university in one of Britain's most exciting, lively cities. The University focuses on professional education, with the majority of degrees awarded also recognized by professional organizations or leading to professional qualifications. Subjects include pharmacy, engineering, ecology, computing, mathematics, architecture, geology, nursing, teaching, sport science, journalism, criminology and business. International students can gain entry to a degree by taking a pathway course on campus at the University of Brighton International College.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n08/06/2026 10:40\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n22/04/2026 05:41\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £21,346.00\nMin: £12,512.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n11%\n2,915 of 26,500 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nKaplan\nFounded Year\n2011\nCampus(es)\nBrighton\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nBelarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Russia, Syria, Ukraine, United States, Pakistan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n30/09/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JNsUDPkvIpo\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
